  "question": {
    "text": "In Young's double-slit experiment,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math> fringes are obtained on a certain segment of the screen when light of wavelength&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>600</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math> is used. If the wavelength of light is changed to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math>, the number of fringes observed on the same segment of the screen is given by"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If on a certain segment of the screen, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;fringes of wavelength <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are present and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;fringes of wavelength&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are present, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>400</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p>"
  }
}